              "id": "CVE-2025-4435-Python",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-4435 high vulnerability for Python package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When using a TarFile.errorlevel = 0┬áand extracting with a filter the documented behavior is that any filtered members would be skipped and not extracted. However the actual behavior of TarFile.errorlevel = 0┬áin affected versions is that the member would still be extracted and not skipped."
