              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-5278 low vulnerability for coreutils package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in GNU Coreutils. The sort utility's begfield() function is vulnerable to a heap buffer under-read. The program may access memory outside the allocated buffer if a user runs a crafted command using the traditional key format. A malicious input could lead to a crash or leak sensitive data."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-5278\nSeverity: low\nPackage: coreutils\nVersion: 9.7-3\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:13\nLink: [CVE-2025-5278](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2025-5278)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-5278**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | coreutils  | 9.7-3  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | debian:distro:debian:13  | [CVE-2025-5278](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2025-5278)  |\n"
              },
